Z||000019||RFMike||08-28-99||12:36 PM||||You CAN'T just try random spark plug arrangements.  Get a Haynes manual and follow the correct firing order.  This is easy, but if you don't you will not get it running right.  This may not be the only problem, but this one you can easily solve, without hiring anybody.
