Z||000027||ezsurf||08-30-99||11:50 AM||||Stetz,<br>Are you sure you were at top dead center when you installed the distributer?  It could be 180 degrees out phase.  It happened to me one of the dozen times I removed the distributer.  Check and make sure all wires are securly connected.  Also, MAKE SURE THERE IS FUEL IN THE TANK, DO NOT TRUST THE GAUGE.  GET UNDERNEATH THE CAR AND KNOCK ON THE TANK TO BE SURE! 
